id: CICD-018
ilities: [integrity]
source: cpm
maturity: 3
action: warn
title: Using npm install instead of npm ci
category: supply-chain
severity: warning
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .yaml .yml
  filenames: Jenkinsfile .travis.yml .circleci/config.yml
  exclude_paths: test/ tests/ .git/ vendor/ node_modules/
  content_contains: npm install
patterns:
  - regex: \bnpm install\b
    message: "npm install in CI modifies lockfile — use npm ci for reproducible builds"
fix: Replace npm install with npm ci in CI pipelines. npm ci installs from package-lock.json exactly, is faster, and fails if lockfile is out of sync.
